2. DICTIONARY DATA & THIRD-PARTY DATASETS
================================================================================

The offline dictionary datasets and ETL pipeline in `scripts/dict-builder/`
aggregate third-party linguistic resources. Those datasets are NOT governed by
Section 1 above; instead, each dataset remains subject to its respective
upstream open license and attribution requirements, including:

- Skypediacode English-Vietnamese Dictionary (CC BY-SA 4.0; upstream MinhQND & OVDP)
- Kaikki.org / Wiktionary extracts (CC BY-SA 4.0)
- Open English WordNet (OEWN) (CC BY 4.0)
- CMU Pronouncing Dictionary (CMUdict) (BSD-style permissive license)
- SCOWL / VarCon Wordlists & GCIDE (their respective open licenses)

Any redistribution of compiled dictionary packs (`dict-*.db` / `dict-*.db.zst`)
must comply with the upstream licenses above, including ShareAlike (CC BY-SA 4.0)
and attribution obligations.
